  "description": "Perfectly positioned within the tranquil heart of the Maylands Peninsula, this charming 2-bedroom villa offers the best of both worlds – peaceful, nature-filled living with the convenience of inner-city access.<br/><br/>Whether you're a professional, downsizer, or lifestyle seeker, this low-maintenance home is designed for comfort, functionality, and easy living.<br/><br/>Property Features:<br/>2 spacious bedrooms (main with built-in robe)<br/>Open-plan living & dining area with natural light<br/>Modern kitchen with crisp white cabinetry & ample storage<br/>Stylish bathroom & integrated laundry with large shower<br/>Private decked courtyard with undercover alfresco – ideal for morning coffee or entertaining<br/>Air conditioning for year-round comfort<br/>Low-maintenance flooring & neutral colour palette throughout<br/>Dedicated parking bay & separate storeroom<br/><br/>Complex Perks:<br/>Sparkling residents' swimming pool<br/>Tennis court for active living<br/>Beautiful landscaped grounds with lush greenery<br/>Direct access to Swan River walkways, cycle paths, parklands, and picnic spots<br/>Public transport at your doorstep<br/>Close to Maylands Golf Course, Tranby House, and popular cafés<br/><br/>Live the Maylands Lifestyle - This villa isn't just a place to live – it's a lifestyle of calm, convenience, and community in one of Perth's most scenic riverside pockets.<br/><br/>Disclaimer:<br/>Thank you for your interest in our rental properties. Should you wish to view the property, please submit an enquiry via the provided link. We will contact you as soon as a home open time is scheduled. We appreciate your understanding and look forward to assisting you.",
